\par\par \b \uc2 GM Lays Off U.S. EV, Battery Workers\b0\par\par\uc2 By Christopher Otts \par \uc2 284 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 October 2025\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal\par \uc2 J\par B3\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2025 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 General Motors\uc2  is laying off thousands of \uc2 UAW\uc2 -represented workers at factories that make electric vehicles and EV batteries as it retrenches from EVs after the end of federal subsidies and the elimination of some emissions regulations.\par \par \uc2 "In response to slower near-term EV adoption and an evolving regulatory environment, \uc2 General Motors\uc2  is realigning EV capacity," the company said.\par \par \uc2 GM plans to lay off more than 3,300 hourly workers at plants across Michigan, Ohio and Tennessee starting in January. Of those, more than 1,700 are being laid off indefinitely, while more than 1,500 are expected to be called back in mid-2026.\par \par \uc2 The automaker said battery plants it jointly owns with \uc2 LG Energy Solution\uc2  in Ohio and Tennessee will be idled starting Jan. 5 and that it plans to resume production in mid-2026.\par \par \uc2 GM is also placing about 1,200 of the 3,400 workers at its dedicated EV assembly plant in Detroit on indefinite layoff.\par \par \uc2 The Detroit EV plant, which typically runs on two shifts, is idle until Nov. 24. Starting next year, it will operate on only one shift.\par \par \uc2 GM Chief Executive \uc2 Mary Barra\uc2  has said EVs remain the company's "North Star" even as it scrambles to reduce its output in the short term.\par \par \uc2 GM took a $1.6 billion special charge related to its EV pullback in the third quarter, recognizing stranded costs such as tooling for a Michigan factory that it had prepared to produce EVs before deciding to assemble gasoline-powered trucks and SUVs there instead.\par \par \uc2 The company will take another charge related to ending production of electric BrightDrop commercial vans in Canada.\par \par \uc2 Document J000000020251030elau0001s\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw300\pich40\picscaley125\picscalex125\picwgoal3600\pichgoal480
